     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br>I am trying to deploy a Shiny-App which uses the function &quot;getData&quot; from the raster package.<br><br>I wrote a little example file below, which uploads and plots a shapefile.<br>By pressing on the Action Button &quot;Plot Elevation&quot;, an SRTM-file should be downloaded, cropped and masked with the given shapefile<br>and should then be plotted.<br><br>When i run the App locally, there seems to be no error.<br>However, when i deploy the app, I get the <b>&quot;Error: file not found&quot;</b> when trying to plot the masked SRTM file.<br>I tried running the &quot;getData&quot;-funtion with &quot;local&quot;, but the error remains the same.<br><br>Am I missing something?<br><br>The shiny-App example in its actual state can be seen and tested at: <a href=\"https://windfarmga.shinyapps.io/srtmtest/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://windfarmga.shinyapps.io/srtmtest/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792390517825000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2JRDaUWYIXwRVmeU1wlEJJ\">https://windfarmga.shinyapps.io/srtmtest/</a><br><br>Many Thanks in advance!!<br><br><br><br><code><span style=\"color:#606\">My</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ui</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">R</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#606\">File</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></code><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shiny</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">raster</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">rgdal</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>source</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;server.R&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">local</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> T</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>ui </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> fluidPage</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  sidebarLayout</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    sidebarPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      fileInput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">inputId</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Shape_SHID&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> label </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Upload all files of a Polygon representing the area, <br>            where the wind farm should be optimized.&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                multiple </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">accept </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;.shp&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;.dbf&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;.sbn&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;.sbx&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#08